OL,3,GNEWSARichard III expert among engineers
OL,4,Ahonoured in show
OL,5,
OL,6,FA professor who helped discover how
OL,7,FRichard III died is among 50 people who
OL,8,Fhave been photographed for an
OL,9,Fexhibition celebrating half a century
OL,10,Fof the Royal Academy of Engineering.
OL,12,FSarah Hainsworth, Pro-Vice-Chancellor
OL,13,Fat Durham University, will feature in
OL,14,Fthe 50for50 exhibition at the National
OL,15,FScience and Media Museum in Bradford.
OL,17,FShe helped to establish the injuries
OL,18,Fthat led to Richard's death, after his
OL,19,Fskeleton was discovered under a council
OL,20,Fcar park in Leicester in 2012.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
